; Zone served by the fixture's local upstream (see Corefile). Only the apex
; has an A record, so every other name, including the workload's
; fwd-<n>.example.com, gets an authoritative NXDOMAIN.
$ORIGIN example.com.
$TTL 60
@  IN SOA ns.example.com. hostmaster.example.com. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@  IN NS  ns.example.com.
@  IN A   192.0.2.1
ns IN A   192.0.2.2
